timestamp=2026-11-08T22:29:54.004Z level=INFO run=50327b16 message=evaluated permission=bash pattern="python3 << 'PY'\nimport re\n\npath = '/app/dataset/genealogy_trees.txt'\nwith open(path) as f:\n    content = f.read()\n\n# The tree is drawn with ASCII/box drawing. Names appear as labels.\n# We need to parse the structure. Let us look more closely at the lines around Dawid Majtyka\n# and extract the full context to understand the format.\n\n# Look at the area containing Dawid Majtyka\nidx = content.find('Dawid Majtyka')\nif idx >= 0:\n    start = max(0, idx - 200)\n    end = min(len(content), idx + 300)\n    print(repr(content[start:end]))\nelse:\n    print('not found')\nPY" action.permission=* action.action=allow action.pattern=*
