timestamp=2026-11-08T22:45:59.810Z level=INFO run=50327b16 message=evaluated permission=bash pattern="python3 << 'PY'\n# So tracing up from Dawid Majtyka: Dawid -> ? (siblings Kazimierz Kiliszek also at same level)\n# Look at the parent of Dawid and Kazimierz. Above them (row 91-92 connecting up to row 89-90 junction), who is the actual parent node?\n# Look at names that sit directly above the junction. The junction at row 90 has its top connector going to row 89. \n# At row 89, there might be a parent name, or the line continues up. Also row 83 showed 'Juliusz Dębosz' near that column area?\n# But when we looked at row 83 around c=2958, we got 'Juliusz Dębosz'. Is Juliusz Dębosz the parent of Kazimierz and Dawid?\n# Or is it higher up? Also row 66 gave 'Kazimierz Kaziród', row 59 'Julita Kucharz', row 46 'Przemysław Kurczab'.\n# These look like ancestors going further up. But which one is the direct parent of Dawid?\n# We need the correct parent-child edges. Let us build the full graph properly by parsing the drawing more systematically.\nPY" action.permission=* action.action=allow action.pattern=*
