timestamp=2026-11-08T22:51:30.627Z level=INFO run=50327b16 message=evaluated permission=bash pattern="python3 << 'PY'\nimport csv\n\n# Build a map from full name to balance\nbalance_map = {}\nwith open('/app/dataset/people_accounts.csv') as f:\n    reader = csv.DictReader(f)\n    for row in reader:\n        full = f\"{row['first_name']} {row['last_name']}\"\n        balance_map[full] = int(row['account_balance'])\n\n# check the children we need\ncandidates = ['Dawid Klupś', 'Kornel Babiuch', 'Józef Schwarz', 'Przemysław Kurczab', 'Bartek Faltyn', 'Olgierd Frukacz']\nfor c in candidates:\n    print(c, balance_map.get(c, 'NOT_FOUND'))\nPY" action.permission=* action.action=allow action.pattern=*
