timestamp=2026-11-08T22:53:06.271Z level=INFO run=50327b16 message=evaluated permission=bash pattern="python3 << 'PY'\n# Let us verify the logic once more to be sure.\n# Great-great-grandparent of Dawid Majtyka: we traced Dawid -> Juliusz (parent) -> Kazimierz Kaziród (grandparent) -> Przemysław Kurczab (great-grandparent) -> Ewelina Rysz (great-great-grandparent). That gives 4 steps up from Dawid to get to great-great-grandparent? Count: from Dawid to parent is 1, to grandparent 2, to great-grandparent 3, to great-great-grandparent 4. So index 4 in chain starting at 0 as Dawid gives Ewelina Rysz. Correct.\n# Children of Ewelina Rysz are those 8 listed. For each, count how many grandchildren they have. Grandchildren = sum of children of each of their children (i.e. total descendants at depth 2 below the child). That is correct.\n# We selected those children with > 1 grandchild. That matches the condition.\n# Sum account balances of those selected children - yes, that's what we did. The total is 147782.\n# Let us write the answer.py as specified.\nPY" action.permission=* action.action=allow action.pattern=*
